  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original whole organism with hammer-shaped broad muzzle and dense filtering dentition, not skull-only or generic marine reptile. [\"Colour, soft tissue, webbing and detailed limb/tail profile are reconstruction choices.\", \"Dentition count deliberately reduced for lowpoly readability, not claimed exact count.\", \"2014 downturned zipper-mouth reconstruction is superseded by2016 hammerhead evidence; do not copy it.\"] {\"body_length_m\": 2.75, \"basis\": \"Approximate genus-sized artistic target from indexed IVPP/CAS author news; direct news page timed out, not a measured V20291 length. Primary skull photos carry2cm bars.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original whole organism with hammer-shaped broad muzzle and dense filtering dentition, not skull-only or generic marine reptile. [\"Colour, soft tissue, webbing and detailed limb/tail profile are reconstruction choices.\", \"Dentition count deliberately reduced for lowpoly readability, not claimed exact count.\", \"2014 downturned zipper-mouth reconstruction is superseded by2016 hammerhead evidence; do not copy it.\"] {\"body_length_m\": 2.75, \"basis\": \"Approximate genus-sized artistic target from indexed IVPP/CAS author news; direct news page timed out, not a measured V20291 length. Primary skull photos carry2cm bars.\"}"
